{"availability":"available","full":"kishoreabc/Portfolio_Tracker","name":"Portfolio_Tracker","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-09T15:47:58Z","updated":"2026-10-04T07:59:06Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://portfolio-tracker-kishoreabcs-projects.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://portfolio-tracker-kishoreabcs-projects.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:16:01.320Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:16:01.320Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:16:01.320Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:01.320Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A comprehensive, modern, multi-asset financial dashboard built with Next.js 16, React 19, and Tailwind CSS v4. Tracks equities and fixed-income bonds directly from your personal Google Sheets, integrates live bond coupon schedules from NSDL, provides a multi-agent AI portfolio analyst with live web grounding, and runs an automated multilingual financial news engine powered by Supabase pgvector and Google Gemini.","### 🤖 Disclaimer: 100% Vibe Coded / AI-Assisted Project This project was completely built using \"vibe coding\" and AI-assisted development. The author possesses foundational full-stack web development knowledge and directed AI agents (such as Google Gemini, Anthropic Claude, and Antigravity) to architect, scaffold, implement, and refine the application. As a consequence: - The codebase, architecture, dependency choices, API integrations, and security practices may contain undiscovered bugs, inefficiencies, suboptimal patterns, or security gaps. - Do not use this codebase in high-stakes…","Traditional portfolio management tools often present significant trade-offs: they lock sensitive financial balances inside proprietary third-party databases, lack native tracking for Indian fixed-income bonds/NCDs, offer static calculations without macroeconomic context, and broadcast generic news disconnected from an investor's personal holdings."],"features":["Ensuring Data Privacy & Sovereignty: Treating your personal Google Sheet as a headless database. The application operates strictly with read-only access—your records remain entirely in your own Google Drive.","First-Class Multi-Asset Support: Native tracking for both Equities (stocks) and Fixed Income (Corporate Bonds, NCDs, SGBs) with credit ratings, face values, yield-to-maturity (YTM), and automated coupon payout schedules.","Automating Bond Due Diligence: Fetching official coupon payment dates, record dates, and cashflow schedules directly from the National Securities Depository Limited (NSDL) database using 12-character ISIN lookups.","Delivering Contextual AI Intelligence: Running a sequential multi-agent AI pipeline that evaluates portfolio health, detects sector concentration risks, cross-references macroeconomic market trends via live web…","Connecting Breaking News to Your Holdings: Ingesting financial RSS feeds, translating regional non-English news into English with strict financial entity preservation, generating vector embeddings, and automatically…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kishoreabc/Portfolio_Tracker/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"2548fe58be2bfc5abee3daaac5e9027bb1f154202a37fd7f242975538660ffe6","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:47.906Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:11:37.537Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A comprehensive, modern, multi-asset financial dashboard built with Next.js 16, React 19, and Tailwind CSS v4. Tracks equities and fixed-income bonds directly from your personal Google Sheets, integrates live bond coupon schedules from NSDL, provides a multi-agent AI portfolio analyst with live web grounding, and runs an automated multilingual financial news engine powered by Supabase pgvector and Google Gemini.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kishoreabc/Portfolio_Tracker/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Authentication: One-click Sign in with Google.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kishoreabc/Portfolio_Tracker/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Non-allowlist Google accounts can sign in, but their default and permanent state is strictly locked to masked privacy mode (••••••).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kishoreabc/Portfolio_Tracker/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"(Optional Fallback) Groq API Key (from Groq Console).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kishoreabc/Portfolio_Tracker/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"(Optional Grounding) Tavily API Key (from Tavily AI).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kishoreabc/Portfolio_Tracker/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2548fe58be2bfc5abee3daaac5e9027bb1f154202a37fd7f242975538660ffe6","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kishoreabc/Portfolio_Tracker/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:11:37.538Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T07:59:06Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kishoreabc/Portfolio_Tracker/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:11:37.539Z","hash":"2548fe58be2bfc5abee3daaac5e9027bb1f154202a37fd7f242975538660ffe6","originalBytes":43723,"storedBytes":43723,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","portfolio","google","news","gemini","supabase","engine","groq","key","model","user","bond","data","privacy","llm","sheets","financial","search","auth","client","get","authenticated","mcp","mode","tavily","dashboard","holdings","vector","audit","create","live","nsdl","run","cashflow","bonds","insights","rss","context","coupon","deterministic","end","login","macro","project","protocol","secret","server","subgraph","table","trigger","web","yes","agent","bash","claim","docker","equity","multi-agent","next.js","route","sync","technical","ur